<div class="ls-craft-details">
<details>
<summary>Files, search and everyday editing</summary>
<p>Ordinary folders and Markdown, including tables, footnotes, code blocks, images and wiki links. Full-text and semantic search use local indexes and return a source passage. Unsaved edits take precedence. Images keep ordinary file references. File name collisions are refused; deleted files go to Trash. <a href="/flow/documents-and-files/">See the complete document tour.</a>
</p>
</details>
<details>
<summary>Long documents, checks and recovery</summary>
<p>Long work is reviewed in ordered parts with range and coverage visible. Checks retain their actual state; an override does not turn a failure into a pass. History records revisions, exact diffs and restore points. Observed cost is distinguished from an estimate. <a href="/flow/specifications/">Read the full technical specification.</a>
</p>
</details>
</div>
</section>
